<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sabre Group started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sabre Group started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs initiated coverage of Sabre Group Holdings Inc with an outperform rating, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/8 at 29-3/4.</p>
